Output demo/tui.gif

Require sey

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1300
Set Height 800
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Type "cd $SEY_DEMO_SCRATCH && clear" Enter
Show

Type `sey -w interpolate substitute . -p`
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s

Enter
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Down
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Type "q"
Sleep 2s
